WEBVTT

00:05:28.574 --> 00:05:30.201
Is it someone you love?

00:05:30.242 --> 00:05:31.827
Is it someone you hate?

00:05:32.411 --> 00:05:34.872
It belongs to this man.

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:39.335
This man.

00:05:41.629 --> 00:05:43.547
At this moment,

00:05:43.589 --> 00:05:48.886
I would like to pay tribute
to all the courageous, brave,

00:05:48.928 --> 00:05:50.763
resilient heroes

00:05:50.763 --> 00:05:53.015
who fight against oppression,

00:05:53.015 --> 00:05:55.518
who fight for human rights,

00:05:55.559 --> 00:05:58.687
dignity, freedom and justice
around the world.

00:05:58.729 --> 00:06:01.065
Let's give them a round of applause.